               <code code="34067-9" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="INDICATIONS &amp; USAGE SECTION"/>
               <title>INDICATIONS</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>Temporarily relieves impatience, being easily irritated, having poor self-image or the feeling of not being clean, resentment, being overly possessive, being easily offended, or being demanding or manipulative.*</paragraph>
